{"content_hash": "0ef83063fc4bac1f", "version_id": 975, "article_id": 98, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Chinese stocks slide as robot and flu bets unwind", "title_zh": "机器人、流感概念退潮，A股高位股集体跌停", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8205442.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517422688858-c17ab068121c?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8Y2hpbmElMjBzdG9ja3MlMjBmYWxsfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ3MDUwOTl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Kido Dong on Unsplash", "author": "Kido Dong", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@likeakid?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/panoramic-photography-of-cn-tower-toronto-canada-1wZ5i0yhHiA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(193, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(231, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "efd1712d6bc7"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-15", "word_count": 242, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "A wave of limit-downs swept China's A-share market on November 13, as speculative bets on robot components and pandemic-era protective gear collapsed and three high-flying stocks hit their first floor of the cycle.", "lead_zh": "11月13日，A股市场出现一波跌停潮，围绕机器人零部件和防疫用品的投机性押注瓦解，三只前期大涨的股票本轮首次触及跌停。", "preview": "All five major indices opened higher before falling steadily. The Shanghai Composite slipped 0.59% to 3634.35, the Shenzhen Component droppe", "preview_zh": "五大指数早盘冲高后一路走低。沪指跌0.59%报3634.35点，深证成指跌2.05%，创业板指跌3.32%。沪深两市成交额缩量2764亿元至1.66万亿元。下跌个股4748只，上涨仅765只，跌停39只，比涨停多出一只。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 958, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 117.0, "size_bytes": 703008, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 280, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 120.8, "size_bytes": 725760, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 280, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/98/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 128.275, "size_bytes": 770544, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 280, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/98/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 110.475, "size_bytes": 663840, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 280, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/98/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 120.3, "size_bytes": 722736, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 280, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/98/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@213c2d8/content/data/versions/975.json", "paragraphs": ["All five major indices opened higher before falling steadily. The Shanghai Composite slipped 0.59% to 3634.35, the Shenzhen Component dropped 2.05%, and the ChiNext Index tumbled 3.32%. Turnover across the two exchanges contracted by 276.4 billion yuan to 1.66 trillion yuan. Decliners outnumbered advancers by 4,748 to 765, with 39 stocks limit-down — one more than those limit-up.", "Three forces drove the selloff. Overnight news that Jensen Huang would step down as Nvidia's chief executive knocked component makers hard, sealing limit-downs for Shanghai Electric, Kinwong and Huazheng New Material. Robot-concept high-flyers, including Xiangyang Bearing after eight straight sessions of gains, were pinned to the floor in late trading, while medical-device names such as Nanfang Sanitary weakened across the board.", "All three featured stocks still trade at premiums of 63% to nearly 100% over their Ji'an valuations, sustained by narrative rather than earnings. Nanfang Sanitary, whose adhesive bandages and protective gear generate 65% of revenue, has seen sales shrink and losses widen; Xiangyang Bearing itself conceded in a filing that its share price had diverged from fundamentals; Daye's tendon rope remains in sample testing, with no orders and no revenue. Until orders, narrowing losses and cash flow materialise, valuation talk is premature.", "Investors should treat rebounds after such sharp drops as noise, not recovery. The three companies share a common flaw: no earnings support. Market attention is better spent tracking fourth-quarter orders, single-quarter gross margins and sample-delivery progress than chasing a falling knife."], "paragraphs_zh": ["五大指数早盘冲高后一路走低。沪指跌0.59%报3634.35点，深证成指跌2.05%，创业板指跌3.32%。沪深两市成交额缩量2764亿元至1.66万亿元。下跌个股4748只，上涨仅765只，跌停39只，比涨停多出一只。", "抛售由三股力量推动。隔夜传出黄仁勋将卸任英伟达首席执行官的消息，重创元件板块，沪电股份、景旺电子、华正新材封死跌停。襄阳轴承等机器人概念高位股在连拉八个板后被尾盘摁在地板；南卫股份等医疗器械股也集体走弱。", "三只重点个股对济安定价的溢价仍在六成三至近一倍，靠的是题材而非业绩。南卫股份的创可贴与防护用品占收入六成五，但收入下滑、亏损扩大；襄阳轴承自己在公告中承认股价偏离基本面；大业股份的腱绳仍停在送样阶段，既无订单也无收入。在订单、减亏与现金流出现之前，谈估值都为时过早。", "急跌后的反抽只是噪音，不是修复。三家公司有一个共同缺陷：没有业绩托底。与其追跌，不如跟踪四季度订单、单季毛利率和送样进展。"], "body": "All five major indices opened higher before falling steadily. The Shanghai Composite slipped 0.59% to 3634.35, the Shenzhen Component dropped 2.05%, and the ChiNext Index tumbled 3.32%. Turnover across the two exchanges contracted by 276.4 billion yuan to 1.66 trillion yuan. Decliners outnumbered advancers by 4,748 to 765, with 39 stocks limit-down — one more than those limit-up.\n\nThree forces drove the selloff. Overnight news that Jensen Huang would step down as Nvidia's chief executive knocked component makers hard, sealing limit-downs for Shanghai Electric, Kinwong and Huazheng New Material. Robot-concept high-flyers, including Xiangyang Bearing after eight straight sessions of gains, were pinned to the floor in late trading, while medical-device names such as Nanfang Sanitary weakened across the board.\n\nAll three featured stocks still trade at premiums of 63% to nearly 100% over their Ji'an valuations, sustained by narrative rather than earnings. Nanfang Sanitary, whose adhesive bandages and protective gear generate 65% of revenue, has seen sales shrink and losses widen; Xiangyang Bearing itself conceded in a filing that its share price had diverged from fundamentals; Daye's tendon rope remains in sample testing, with no orders and no revenue. Until orders, narrowing losses and cash flow materialise, valuation talk is premature.\n\nInvestors should treat rebounds after such sharp drops as noise, not recovery. The three companies share a common flaw: no earnings support. Market attention is better spent tracking fourth-quarter orders, single-quarter gross margins and sample-delivery progress than chasing a falling knife.", "body_zh": "五大指数早盘冲高后一路走低。沪指跌0.59%报3634.35点，深证成指跌2.05%，创业板指跌3.32%。沪深两市成交额缩量2764亿元至1.66万亿元。下跌个股4748只，上涨仅765只，跌停39只，比涨停多出一只。\n\n抛售由三股力量推动。隔夜传出黄仁勋将卸任英伟达首席执行官的消息，重创元件板块，沪电股份、景旺电子、华正新材封死跌停。襄阳轴承等机器人概念高位股在连拉八个板后被尾盘摁在地板；南卫股份等医疗器械股也集体走弱。\n\n三只重点个股对济安定价的溢价仍在六成三至近一倍，靠的是题材而非业绩。南卫股份的创可贴与防护用品占收入六成五，但收入下滑、亏损扩大；襄阳轴承自己在公告中承认股价偏离基本面；大业股份的腱绳仍停在送样阶段，既无订单也无收入。在订单、减亏与现金流出现之前，谈估值都为时过早。\n\n急跌后的反抽只是噪音，不是修复。三家公司有一个共同缺陷：没有业绩托底。与其追跌，不如跟踪四季度订单、单季毛利率和送样进展。", "text": "All five major indices opened higher before falling steadily. The Shanghai Composite slipped 0.59% to 3634.35, the Shenzhen Component dropped 2.05%, and the ChiNext Index tumbled 3.32%. Turnover across the two exchanges contracted by 276.4 billion yuan to 1.66 trillion yuan. Decliners outnumbered advancers by 4,748 to 765, with 39 stocks limit-down — one more than those limit-up. Three forces drove the selloff. Overnight news that Jensen Huang would step down as Nvidia's chief executive knocked component makers hard, sealing limit-downs for Shanghai Electric, Kinwong and Huazheng New Material. Robot-concept high-flyers, including Xiangyang Bearing after eight straight sessions of gains, were pinned to the floor in late trading, while medical-device names such as Nanfang Sanitary weakened across the board. All three featured stocks still trade at premiums of 63% to nearly 100% over their Ji'an valuations, sustained by narrative rather than earnings. Nanfang Sanitary, whose adhesive bandages and protective gear generate 65% of revenue, has seen sales shrink and losses widen; Xiangyang Bearing itself conceded in a filing that its share price had diverged from fundamentals; Daye's tendon rope remains in sample testing, with no orders and no revenue. Until orders, narrowing losses and cash flow materialise, valuation talk is premature. Investors should treat rebounds after such sharp drops as noise, not recovery. The three companies share a common flaw: no earnings support. Market attention is better spent tracking fourth-quarter orders, single-quarter gross margins and sample-delivery progress than chasing a falling knife.", "vocab": [{"word": "limit-down", "pos": "adj", "zh": "跌停的", "note": "A股术语，指股价触及当日跌幅下限", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "selloff", "pos": "noun", "zh": "抛售", "note": "常与 broad、sharp 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "high-flyer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "高位大涨股", "note": "指涨幅惊人的股票或公司", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "premium", "pos": "noun", "zh": "溢价", "note": "trade at a premium to/over", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "valuation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "估值", "note": "金融语境常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sustain", "pos": "verb", "zh": "支撑、维持", "note": "被动语态 sustained by 很常见", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "concede", "pos": "verb", "zh": "承认", "note": "比 admit 更正式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "diverge from", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "偏离", "note": "diverge from fundamentals 偏离基本面", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "materialise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "成为现实、落实", "note": "英式拼写，美式为 materialize", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "narrative", "pos": "noun", "zh": "叙事、题材故事", "note": "市场语境指炒作逻辑", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "falling knife", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "下跌中的飞刀", "note": "catch a falling knife 指抄底接刀", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rebound", "pos": "noun", "zh": "反弹", "note": "常与 sharp、technical 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "turnover", "pos": "noun", "zh": "成交额", "note": "也可指人员流动率", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pin to the floor", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "摁在跌停板上", "note": "形象说法，指封死跌停", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-15T01:11:22.487134", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "All", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.537, "sm": 300, "em": 537, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "five", "s": 0.537, "e": 0.9, "sm": 537, "em": 899, "cs": 4, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "major", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.175, "sm": 900, "em": 1175, "cs": 9, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "indices", "s": 1.175, "e": 1.7, "sm": 1175, "em": 1699, "cs": 15, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "opened", "s": 1.7, "e": 2.0, "sm": 1700, "em": 2000, "cs": 23, "ce": 29, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "higher", "s": 2.0, "e": 2.35, "sm": 2000, "em": 2350, "cs": 30, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "before", "s": 2.35, "e": 2.712, "sm": 2350, "em": 2712, "cs": 37, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "falling", "s": 2.712, "e": 3.075, "sm": 2712, "em": 3074, "cs": 44, "ce": 51, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "steadily", "s": 3.075, "e": 3.975, "sm": 3075, "em": 3975, "cs": 52, "ce": 60, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": ".", "s": 3.975, "e": 4.125, "sm": 3975, "em": 4124, "cs": 60, "ce": 61, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "The", "s": 4.125, "e": 4.225, "sm": 4125, "em": 4224, "cs": 62, "ce": 65, "si": 1}, {"i": 11, "w": "Shanghai", "s": 4.225, "e": 4.6, "s